hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"50","Jumu'ah ke bare mein. Hum se Ahmad ibn Amr ibn al-Sarh ne bayan kiya, hamein Ibn Wahb ne khabar di, mujhe Yunus ne khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne kaha: Hamein yeh baat pahunchi hai ke Hazrat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Ahl-e-Awali ko apni masjid mein Jumu'ah ke din jama kiya; jo Musalman Al-Aqiq aur is jaisi jagahon par thay woh Jumu'ah ke liye aate thay. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Malik ne kaha: Al-Awali Madinah se teen meel par hai."
"51","Hum se Abbad ibn Musa ne bayan kiya, hamein Hushaym ne khabar di, hamein Yunus ne khabar di, al-Hasan se, unhon ne kaha: Khawateen Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke sath Jumu'ah mein sharik hoti thin."
"52","Hum se Mahmud ibn Khalid ne bayan kiya, hum se al-Walid ne bayan kiya, hum se Abu Amr ne bayan kiya, Wasil se, Mujahid se, unhon ne kaha: Mardon aur auraton mein se kamzor log Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke sath Jumu'ah mein hazir hote thay, phir kamzori ki wajah se agle din tak apne thikanon par wapas na laut-te thay."
"53","Hum se al-Nufayli ne bayan kiya; main ne Ma'qil ibn Ubaydullah par qira'at ki, al-Zuhri se, ke Hazrat Mus'ab ibn Umayr ne, jab Hazrat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne unhein Madinah bheja, unhein Jumu'ah parhaya, aur woh barah afrad thay."
